6:a14b8717cade62f728d641c48b16c351b1c204f5c2cf16ff4ba9cc4b3f283d4d","download_count":1348,"created_at":"2026-10-08T11:48:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T11:48:02Z"},{"id":621661170,"node_id":"RA_kwDOR_sfj84lDcvy","name":"latest.yml","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"text/yaml","state":"uploaded","size":350,"digest":"sha256:6e24c469609feb73c58c0d69b812b66c08182d8364466c7472f5f22efe01e6cb","download_count":2125,"created_at":"2026-10-08T11:40:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-08T11:40:36Z"}],"body":"## 更新重点\n\n- 桌面端聊天和群聊新增区域截图与标注工具，支持自定义全局快捷键，并适配 Windows、macOS 和 Linux 截图方式 (#3312)\n- 修复截图遮罩异常后聊天窗口无法恢复的问题，截图结束或失败时恢复原有窗口状态 (#3318)\n- 新建聊天记住上次选择的 Agent，刷新后也能恢复选择 (#3320)\n- 收藏和最近使用的工作区目录按账号保存，可在不同浏览器中继续使用 (#3317)\n- 修复编程 Agent 使用 vLLM 等 Chat Completions 接口进行流式调用时缺少 Token 用量统计的问题 (#3314)\n- 改善 Hermes 聊天重连后的状态恢复，修复完成或停止后仍显示运行中的问题，并确保排队消息继续执行 (#3321)\n- 修复 Linux 桌面端开机自启，并完善桌面启动失败时的错误提示与诊断信息 (#3307、#3308)\n- 移除群聊中已过时的升级提示 (#3306)\n- Studio 与桌面端版本同步更新为 `0.7.32`，前端更新日志补齐 11 种语言并保留最近三个版本 (#3323)\n\n## What's Changed\n* [codex] remove group chat upgrade notice by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3306\n* [codex] make Linux Open at Login register desktop autostart by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3307\n* [codex] preserve desktop backend startup errors by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3308\n* [codex] add desktop screenshots, platform support and global shortcuts by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3312\n* [codex] persist workspace history and favorites by account by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3317\n* [coding-agent] request stream usage from Chat Completions providers by @WenhuaXia in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3314\n* [codex] isolate desktop screenshot failures by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3318\n* [codex] remember the last Agent selected for new chats by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3320\n* [codex] fix Hermes run state recovery and finalization by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3321\n* [codex] prepare Studio 0.7.32 with localized changelog by @EKKOLearnAI in https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/pull/3323\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/EKKOLearnAI/ekko-studio/compare/v0.7.31...v0.7.32","mentions_count":2}
